{"id":218,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Slugma does not have any blood in its body. Instead, intensely hot magma circulates throughout this Pokémon’s body, carrying essential nutrients and oxygen to its organs."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Molten magma courses throughout Slugma’s circulatory system. If this Pokémon is chilled, the magma cools and hardens. Its body turns brittle and chunks fall off, reducing its size."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"Its body is made of magma. If it doesn’t keep moving, its body will cool and harden."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"A common sight in volcanic areas, it slowly slithers around in a constant search for warm places."},{"games":["HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"It never sleeps. It has to keep moving because if it stopped, its magma body would cool and harden."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It is a species of POKéMON that lives in volcanic areas. If its body cools, its skin hardens and immobilizes it. To avoid that, it sleeps near magma."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"These group together in areas that are hotter than normal. If it cools off, its skin hardens."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Magma Armor","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon’s hot magma coating prevents it from being frozen."},{"name":"Flame Body","hidden":false,"description":"Contact with the Pokémon may burn the attacker."},{"name":"Weak Armor","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's Defense stat is lowered when it takes damage from physical moves, but its Speed stat is sharply boosted."}],"eggGroups":["Amorphous"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"mountain","color":"Red","shape":"Squiggle","evolution":{"id":218,"name":"Slugma","condition":null,"children":[{"id":219,"name":"Magcargo","condition":"Lv. 38","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,123],[1,281]